{
  "about": "Cooking at an oven and buying/selling at a shop (rules: src/engine/rules/Kitchen.js). A recipe 'needs' exact items ('item') or any items of a bag group ('group': eggs, fruit, berries, veggies, honey, ...), 'count' each (1 if left out). 'makes' is an art.json item. A shop 'sells' items for coins and 'buys' items or whole groups; an oven or shop in a room or region file names nothing here except the shop id ('shop'). 'share': talk to a friend while carrying something from this bag group and they take one (never food a quest still needs); 'say' lines take turns, {treat} = its name; a person can have their own 'treatSay', or 'treats': false to never take any (rules: GameRules.shareTreat).",
